    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedurally generated levels, collecting unique weapons and items while fending off cave dwellers. </strong> <br><strong>Complete quests and alter your path as you descend deeper. </strong><br> <strong>Your only way out is down, but something waits for you in the depths of the Mine...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u><strong>Combat :</strong></u> <br>Use weapons, items, boxes, spikes, and minecarts to fend off cave dwellers and descend deeper into the abyss! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/69141856987f4f867ffead4ee430291f.poster.avif?t=1753439709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/69141856987f4f867ffead4ee430291f.webm?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/69141856987f4f867ffead4ee430291f.mp4?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Minecart level :</u></strong><br>Between levels, you'll ride a minecart where your choices influence the layout of the next level. Change the minecart\u2019s direction to shape what lies ahead!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/fb06c0b4e8ac52c6e216d29aa1bd04e4.poster.avif?t=1753439709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/fb06c0b4e8ac52c6e216d29aa1bd04e4.webm?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/fb06c0b4e8ac52c6e216d29aa1bd04e4.mp4?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Quests and Achievements :</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests as you progress through each level. whether it's delivering bones to a Monolith or offering spinach to the Vendor.  <br>Completing these challenges rewards you with unique items and may even alter how the next level is generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you could always decide that death is the only fitting end for these characters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/467c3756120f27cc355fb961401895e6.poster.avif?t=1753439709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/467c3756120f27cc355fb961401895e6.webm?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/467c3756120f27cc355fb961401895e6.mp4?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Virtue (<i>Coming Soon</i>) :</u></strong><br>Your decisions for helping or killing Neutral characters such as the Blacksmith or the Vendor, will effect the characters virtue, influencing the generation of the next level! (More to come)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot afford to financially support the game, but still want to help:<br><strong><u>Wishlisting</u></strong> the game and following us on social media, REALLY does help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Thank you</u></strong> and I hope you enjoy playing Dwarfs Descent!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedurally generated levels, collecting unique weapons and items while fending off cave dwellers. </strong> <br><strong>Complete quests and alter your path as you descend deeper. </strong><br> <strong>Your only way out is down, but something waits for you in the depths of the Mine...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u><strong>Combat :</strong></u> <br>Use weapons, items, boxes, spikes, and minecarts to fend off cave dwellers and descend deeper into the abyss! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/69141856987f4f867ffead4ee430291f.poster.avif?t=1753439709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/69141856987f4f867ffead4ee430291f.webm?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/69141856987f4f867ffead4ee430291f.mp4?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Minecart level :</u></strong><br>Between levels, you'll ride a minecart where your choices influence the layout of the next level. Change the minecart\u2019s direction to shape what lies ahead!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/fb06c0b4e8ac52c6e216d29aa1bd04e4.poster.avif?t=1753439709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/fb06c0b4e8ac52c6e216d29aa1bd04e4.webm?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/fb06c0b4e8ac52c6e216d29aa1bd04e4.mp4?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Quests and Achievements :</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests as you progress through each level. whether it's delivering bones to a Monolith or offering spinach to the Vendor.  <br>Completing these challenges rewards you with unique items and may even alter how the next level is generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you could always decide that death is the only fitting end for these characters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/467c3756120f27cc355fb961401895e6.poster.avif?t=1753439709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/467c3756120f27cc355fb961401895e6.webm?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/467c3756120f27cc355fb961401895e6.mp4?t=1753439709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Virtue (<i>Coming Soon</i>) :</u></strong><br>Your decisions for helping or killing Neutral characters such as the Blacksmith or the Vendor, will effect the characters virtue, influencing the generation of the next level! (More to come)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot afford to financially support the game, but still want to help:<br><strong><u>Wishlisting</u></strong> the game and following us on social media, REALLY does help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Thank you</u></strong> and I hope you enjoy playing Dwarfs Descent!</p>",
